{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Stagmon has been a ghost town for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone's gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please dont come looking for me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love you,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >David&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/7f8a41d82686e29f7cce6817f2dfdfb6.poster.avif?t=1769371319\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/7f8a41d82686e29f7cce6817f2dfdfb6.webm?t=1769371319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/7f8a41d82686e29f7cce6817f2dfdfb6.mp4?t=1769371319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Stagmon - Step into the abandoned town of Stagmon, uncovering hidden paths, scarce supplies and creatures lurking in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INVENTORY MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/d6a67bc5b253506e8aaaa926fc3d3d53.poster.avif?t=1769371319\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/d6a67bc5b253506e8aaaa926fc3d3d53.webm?t=1769371319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550000/extras/d6a67bc5b253506e8aaaa926fc3d3d53.mp4?t=1769371319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pr